{"content":[{"c":["ADONI-ZEDEK"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Amorite king of Jerusalem at the time of the Israelite conquest of the Promised Land (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.10.1-5","r":"Josh.10.1-5","rawR":"Josh.10.1-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.10.1-5","value":"Josh.10.1-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 10:1-5"},"). A battle between the Amorites and Israelites for control of Gibeon was the occasion on which Joshua prayed for the sun to stand still (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.10.6-15","r":"Josh.10.6-15","rawR":"Josh.10.6-15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.10.6-15","value":"Josh.10.6-15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 10:6-15"},"). The Israelites won a decisive victory. Adoni-zedek and four other enemy kings were discovered hiding in a cave and were executed by Joshua (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.10.16-27","r":"Josh.10.16-27","rawR":"Josh.10.16-27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.10.16-27","value":"Josh.10.16-27"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 10:16-27"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=ConquestandAllotmentoftheLand_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"ConquestandAllotmentoftheLand_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"ConquestandAllotmentoftheLand_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Conquest and Allotment of the Land"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"AdoniZedek","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 10:1-5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.10.1-5","rawQueryValue":"Josh.10.1-5","sourceRefExact":"Josh.10.1-5"},{"anchorText":"Jos 10:6-15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.10.6-15","rawQueryValue":"Josh.10.6-15","sourceRefExact":"Josh.10.6-15"},{"anchorText":"Jos 10:16-27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.10.16-27","rawQueryValue":"Josh.10.16-27","sourceRefExact":"Josh.10.16-27"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"5e057437c6a1692476c6119fa407e8191405e826dff89f5f80a350123466eefe","sourceItemName":"AdoniZedek","sourceItemOrder":134,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"AdoniZedek","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Adoni-Zedek","title":"Adoni-Zedek","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}